# graphify — generated knowledge graph. Regenerate with `graphify update .`
# (AST-only, ~1 min, no API cost). Not committed: graph.json + graph.html are
# ~3MB and change on every code edit, so they'd bloat history fast. The config
# that matters (.claude/settings.json, CLAUDE.md) IS committed.
graphify-out/

.claude/settings.local.json
